{% set prompt %}
You are generating a short conversation title from the user's first message.

<Task>
Generate one short title for the conversation.
</Task>

<Rules>
- Use 5 words maximum.
- Capture the main request or topic.
- Use concise natural language.
- Avoid filler words like "please", "help", "can you", and similar phrases.
- Do not add punctuation at the end.
- If the message is only a greeting like "hello" or "hi", return "General conversation".
- If the request is unclear, return the best short topic guess.
- Return only the title text.
</Rules>

<Examples>
User: How can I change the password in my account?
Title: Change account password

User: Can you add a new step to this automation scenario?
Title: Add automation step

User: hello
Title: General conversation
</Examples>

<UserMessage>
{{GetTriggeredAct().text}}
</UserMessage>
{% endset %}

{% system %}
{{prompt.strip()}}
{% end %}

{% set title = Gen(temperature=0.1, topP=0, thinkingBudget=85).strip() %}

{{SendCommand(
   commandIdn="update_chat_title",
   integrationIdn="newo_chat",
   connectorIdn="vibe_agent",
   user_actor_id=GetActor().id|string,
   title=title
)}}
{{UpdateActor(name=title)}}
